{"seq":2,"slug":"simulation","title":"模拟技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-based-simulation","title":"基于代理的经济仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation/agent-based-simulation","wordCount":572,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-forecast","title":"蒙特卡洛经济预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation/monte-carlo-forecast","wordCount":553,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"equilibrium-analysis","title":"均衡分析与博弈论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation/equilibrium-analysis","wordCount":659,"readingTime":3}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"模拟技术\">模拟技术</h1><p>本章介绍游戏经济仿真的三大核心技术方法。三篇文档分别覆盖基于代理的经济仿真（ABM）、蒙特卡洛经济预测和均衡分析。这三种方法各有适用场景，在实际工程中往往组合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>基于代理的经济仿真（ABM）</strong> — NetLogo/Mesa 框架、agent 行为规则建模、emergent patterns 识别与分析。</li>\n<li><strong>蒙特卡洛经济预测</strong> — 玩家生命周期经济轨迹仿真、概率分布拟合、置信区间估算。</li>\n<li><strong>均衡分析与博弈论</strong> — Nash 均衡、Vickrey 拍卖理论、市场清算条件的数值求解。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"三种方法对比\">三种方法对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ABM</td>\n<td>「玩家互动产生什么涌现行为？」</td>\n<td>高（需并行计算）</td>\n<td>设计评审阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>「玩家生命周期的收入分布是什么？」</td>\n<td>中（可批量并行）</td>\n<td>商业化参数设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均衡分析</td>\n<td>「市场价格收敛到哪里？」</td>\n<td>低（数值优化）</td>\n<td>定价策略验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}